      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Messages｜结构图\n观察者消息，不是 GA 指令。[[Messages/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1530,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHealthSet\n正伤害广播 Damage、正韧性伤害广播 PoiseBreak；治疗路径目前不广播此消息。[[AbilitySystem/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "payload",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOVerbMessage\n`Verb` → 类型；`Instigator/Target` → 参与者；`InstigatorTags/TargetTags/ContextTags` → 语义；`Magnitude` → 原始数值。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "router",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGameplayMessageSubsystem（UE）\n按 Verb 通道广播载荷；不保存 GAS 权威状态。",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "readers",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UI / 音频 / 统计\n只读订阅已发生事件；不会从消息反向改 ASC。",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GameplayEvent（另一路）\n发给指定 Actor 的 ASC，驱动 Ability 逻辑；不经观察者消息。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
